71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J_v2ofWoNE8Q7kNvwE-ir1l&_nc_oc=Adp4v8o3z-CI3BiVInXNk3vYCFijk64YY6_G_3DWs4bR0j7ZS62K2dUYZ9I_77jExTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8k2pYI0IoU_Zo0XhuEkRFtVFF3XAfzp15um9CtX6uoJg&oe=6A411D39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LxZzoHGIAUsQ7kNvwHtjOgl&_nc_oc=AdqB_2XVx8xW52rVpL9BEa7gOVSlaREaNVYVYLEAJDdRQ76ZxzpXi83SOj_Sf9yB8Eo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_yzPZPXYPj2oQP3QIPoHlybPAg4U2du-bR3dsZdNvKsw&oe=6A413013"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0tyKyPKN6MgQ7kNvwHTy0lA&_nc_oc=AdrunmMuaX3By5IsHNuutyMaxcmyBW-RtXJJGtSLokiIxpMaR7NoCm83lFc2fNZ9-yM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8tDqNq6sQkurIafby7qva0bGYkArT80dDDdgSjRHI3VA&oe=6A412E5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: